OL,5,G2230 A&E After Dark                    
OL,6,     FDoctors have minutes to save a    
OL,7,     Fman's sight in East London after a
OL,8,     Fviolent attack, while in Belfast  
OL,9,     Furgent tests assess an elderly    
OL,10,     Ffarmer with suspected             
OL,11,     Flife-threatening abdominal pain.  
OL,12,G2335 Ambulance: Code Red               
OL,13,     FAfter a woman suffers cardiac     
OL,14,     Farrest while driving, paramedics  
OL,15,     Fmust induce a coma at the roadside
OL,16,     Fto save her. Meanwhile, a         
OL,17,     F19-year-old suffers critical      
OL,18,     Finjuries in a motorcycle crash.   
